gantt
    title STAR 5-minute Demo Timeline
    dateFormat mm:ss
    axisFormat %M:%S

    section Presenter 1 (Team Lead)
    Opening hook (stats)        :done, p1a, 00:00, 15s
    Closing impact              :crit, p1b, 04:00, 20s

    section Presenter 2 (Member 2)
    Problem statement           :done, p2a, 00:15, 30s
    Hardware walkthrough        :done, p2b, 00:45, 45s
    Button press + live run     :crit, p2c, 01:30, 90s

    section Presenter 3 (Hardware Lead)
    Live run narration          :crit, p3a, 01:30, 90s

    section Presenter 4 (Software Lead)
    Map + PDF reveal            :crit, p4a, 03:00, 60s

    section Contingency
    Q&A buffer / transition     :p5a, 04:20, 40s
